SAKURAMORI
SECOND GENERAL HOSPITAL

00:01:37.424 --> 00:01:40.624
Must be nice... Everyone's having a good time.

00:01:42.364 --> 00:01:48.164
I wish I could wear a cute swimsuit like that
and play with everyone, too.

00:01:48.874 --> 00:01:53.774
Episode 6
Magi? There's a Ghost?

00:01:56.244 --> 00:01:58.444
Not many people know about this,

00:01:58.444 --> 00:02:01.504
but there's a secret about our
school's swimming pool.

00:02:04.954 --> 00:02:06.584
A long, long time ago,

00:02:06.584 --> 00:02:11.824
one of the female students at Sakuramori Academy
spotted a cute swimsuit at a store,

00:02:11.824 --> 00:02:14.934
but the swimsuit was very expensive,

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:18.024
so she saved up money,
working a part-time job.

00:02:18.434 --> 00:02:22.204
But, as she was happily on her way
to the store to buy the swimsuit...

00:02:28.074 --> 00:02:30.744
So! Let's go home!

00:02:30.884 --> 00:02:31.114
SQUISH!

00:02:31.114 --> 00:02:32.584
SQUISH!
You idiot!

00:02:32.584 --> 00:02:33.104
SQUISH!

00:02:33.884 --> 00:02:36.114
You told me you can't swim,

00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:38.424
so I'm sacrificing my precious vacation
time to teach you how!

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.754
And you're trying to bail out on me
with a lame excuse like that?!

00:02:41.354 --> 00:02:44.624
B-But I heard that story from a reliable source and...

00:02:44.624 --> 00:02:45.764
I bet you heard it from those idiots
in the Supernatural Science Club!
B-But I heard that story from a reliable source and...

00:02:45.764 --> 00:02:47.994
I bet you heard it from those idiots
in the Supernatural Science Club!

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:52.134
Anyway, I don't care if your skin gets all wrinkly
from the water or you drown,

00:02:52.134 --> 00:02:53.224
you're not getting away from me today!

00:02:53.904 --> 00:02:56.894
Yay! Fun!

00:03:01.314 --> 00:03:02.144
Pass me the ball!

00:03:02.144 --> 00:03:03.234
Here you go!

00:03:04.144 --> 00:03:07.984
Wow, this is pretty good for
a school swimming pool, huh?

00:03:07.984 --> 00:03:11.714
That's why they keep it open to the public
during the summer!

00:03:15.794 --> 00:03:18.964
My school-issued swimsuit is cute and nice!

00:03:18.964 --> 00:03:19.764
See, Haruo!

00:03:19.764 --> 00:03:20.064
Check this out!

00:03:20.064 --> 00:03:21.734
OH! IT'S
FIERCE!
Check this out!

00:03:22.134 --> 00:03:28.174
So what if I can't swim?
That doesn't affect my everyday life in any way.

00:03:28.174 --> 00:03:31.534
So I was thinking, maybe I don't have to
push myself to do this...

00:03:32.144 --> 00:03:33.574
What's your damn problem?!

00:03:33.644 --> 00:03:36.644
It might not affect your life, but it affects mine!

00:03:36.644 --> 00:03:40.744
I have a mission to train your body
through swimming!

00:03:42.484 --> 00:03:49.324
Ha! People used to call me a wimp,
but thanks to swimming, I look so macho now!

00:03:49.324 --> 00:03:51.454
You're so hot!

00:03:51.724 --> 00:03:53.454
Hey!

00:03:53.794 --> 00:03:55.164
You passed!

00:03:55.834 --> 00:03:56.394
Smooch!

00:03:56.394 --> 00:03:57.764
Haha!

00:04:00.804 --> 00:04:05.264
So get your butt in the water and start swimming!

00:04:06.244 --> 00:04:08.914
Hey, that's Mamiya from Class B, right?

00:04:08.914 --> 00:04:11.434
A-Ayumi in a swimsuit...

00:04:12.544 --> 00:04:14.514
I'd love to get done by her, too...

00:04:15.184 --> 00:04:16.884
This isn't good.

00:04:16.884 --> 00:04:21.054
If I keep dealing with Haruo like this in front of
people, I'll draw everyone's attention.

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:22.524
Besides,

00:04:22.524 --> 00:04:25.584
she's about to explode...

00:04:28.164 --> 00:04:31.034
There's no one at the pool over there.

00:04:33.264 --> 00:04:35.394
Grin.

00:04:35.604 --> 00:04:36.434
Hey!

00:04:36.434 --> 00:04:37.474
Haruo's flying!

00:04:37.474 --> 00:04:37.944
Swim...
Haruo's flying!

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:38.404
Swim...

00:04:38.604 --> 00:04:40.404
What?! Big Brother's swimming?!

00:04:40.644 --> 00:04:41.904
Now's my chance!

00:04:46.814 --> 00:04:50.184
Mamiya, are you sure about this?

00:04:50.184 --> 00:04:53.794
You can see it's locked, so I don't think
we should just go inside...

00:04:53.794 --> 00:04:57.284
If you're a man, stop being so damn shaky!

00:05:00.994 --> 00:05:01.964
Huh?

00:05:02.064 --> 00:05:04.494
It looks like a couple of weirdoes
got here before us...

00:05:04.964 --> 00:05:06.994
Hey, it's Hajime and Sora.

00:05:07.704 --> 00:05:10.694
Yo, Haruo! Ayumi's with you, eh?

00:05:12.044 --> 00:05:13.404
Y-Yeah...

00:05:13.404 --> 00:05:16.174
I happened to run into her on the way here.

00:05:16.174 --> 00:05:17.304
Hmph!

00:05:17.944 --> 00:05:20.684
B-By the way, what are you guys doing here?

00:05:20.684 --> 00:05:25.744
Strange phenomena follow us wherever we go!

00:05:26.054 --> 00:05:29.424
This old-looking pool is...

00:05:29.424 --> 00:05:32.394
THE CURSED POOL!

00:05:33.634 --> 00:05:35.154
I knew it!

00:05:35.564 --> 00:05:40.094
We're currently conducting research in order to
solve the mysteries of this haunted swimming pool!

00:05:40.634 --> 00:05:42.004
Why, you ask?

00:05:42.434 --> 00:05:45.174
BECAUSE THERE ARE MYSTERIES THERE!

00:05:45.174 --> 00:05:46.174
Here we go again...

00:05:46.174 --> 00:05:49.044
So anyway...

00:05:49.044 --> 00:05:51.214
we're off to the lab for an infinite
exploration of the unknown

00:05:51.214 --> 00:05:54.684
and this magnificent mission
called "investigation"!

00:05:54.684 --> 00:05:58.954
Be sure not to get in the pool or mess with Ayumi!

00:05:58.954 --> 00:05:59.784
See ya!

00:06:00.424 --> 00:06:02.054
Yeah, sure...

00:06:07.664 --> 00:06:12.264
Haunted pool? Come on, give me a break!
It's totally ridiculous!

00:06:13.934 --> 00:06:15.874
Hey, Mamiya!

00:06:19.904 --> 00:06:22.374
See, nothing happened!

00:06:24.314 --> 00:06:25.334
Mamiya!

00:06:25.844 --> 00:06:27.004
Did you call me?

00:06:30.884 --> 00:06:32.654
I was just kidding!

00:06:33.554 --> 00:06:36.324
I-I knew that.

00:06:39.094 --> 00:06:40.394
Look!

00:06:40.564 --> 00:06:42.894
It's cold and feels great!

00:06:43.634 --> 00:06:45.894
Oh... Okay...

00:06:48.004 --> 00:06:48.994
Come on!

00:06:51.844 --> 00:06:53.134
Thanks...

00:06:59.384 --> 00:07:01.054
Whaddya mean "Thanks"?!

00:07:01.054 --> 00:07:03.614
Your swimming training starts right now!

00:07:03.614 --> 00:07:06.054
Come on, move it! Swim!

00:07:06.054 --> 00:07:08.994
Okay! Right! Left! Right! Left!

00:07:08.994 --> 00:07:11.794
Right! Left! Right! Left!

00:07:11.794 --> 00:07:15.494
Your body floats on its own
if you hold air in your lungs!

00:07:15.494 --> 00:07:17.434
I-Is that true?

00:07:17.434 --> 00:07:19.904
The air goes out if you talk!

00:07:19.904 --> 00:07:21.564
Come on, give me good kicks!

00:07:22.634 --> 00:07:24.144
Don't let go of my hands, okay?

00:07:24.144 --> 00:07:27.044
If you keep on whining like that, I will, you know!

00:07:27.044 --> 00:07:28.604
Oh, give me a break...

00:07:29.044 --> 00:07:32.774
Jeez, you're just like a baby, you know that, Haruo?

00:07:32.984 --> 00:07:35.144
But I'm still doing my best!

00:07:39.824 --> 00:07:42.554
Who's there? Where are you?

00:07:43.024 --> 00:07:45.794
If you're not gonna show yourself...

00:07:45.794 --> 00:07:47.994
I'm coming to get you!

00:08:06.984 --> 00:08:10.084
Sure, you can rip my swimsuit,
but that can be fixed in a flash!

00:08:10.084 --> 00:08:13.924
You picked the wrong person to pick a fight with!

00:08:13.924 --> 00:08:16.414
What just happened?

00:08:16.654 --> 00:08:17.814
Huh?

00:08:24.064 --> 00:08:25.624
This is...

00:08:34.914 --> 00:08:36.674
M-Mamiya?!

00:08:40.554 --> 00:08:43.584
I-I can't breathe!

00:08:43.584 --> 00:08:45.014
Mamiya!

00:08:49.454 --> 00:08:50.684
Ow!

00:08:51.264 --> 00:08:52.784
Mamiya!

00:08:54.064 --> 00:08:57.304
I thought I felt a disturbance in the air.
I should've known it was you!

00:08:57.304 --> 00:08:59.304
How dare you try to kill my senior?!

00:08:59.304 --> 00:09:02.464
I see you've finally shown your true colors,
you evil witch!

00:09:02.534 --> 00:09:05.374
Kurosu... and Nijihara, too?

00:09:05.374 --> 00:09:07.234
What's going on here?

00:09:07.714 --> 00:09:08.874
HEY!

00:09:08.874 --> 00:09:10.944
How come it's MY FAULT?!

00:09:10.944 --> 00:09:12.974
THAT'S the thing responsible for this!

00:09:20.384 --> 00:09:21.444
That's a...

00:09:21.854 --> 00:09:22.954
Here it comes!

00:09:34.034 --> 00:09:36.474
Big Brother!

00:09:36.734 --> 00:09:39.604
What happened?! Big Brother!

00:09:40.614 --> 00:09:41.374
Huh?!

00:09:44.284 --> 00:09:45.684
Oh, my...

00:09:45.684 --> 00:09:49.514
Hey, Ayumi, what in the world happened here?

00:09:49.514 --> 00:09:52.884
Th-The water started attacking us
all of a sudden and...

00:09:52.884 --> 00:09:55.654
We managed to avoid it somehow, but...

00:09:57.264 --> 00:10:00.164
Senior! Senior!

00:10:00.164 --> 00:10:02.264
What happened to Big Brother?!

00:10:02.264 --> 00:10:05.234
Haruo turned into that thing...

00:10:17.544 --> 00:10:24.584
There's no way I'll let you fool me
with nonsense like this!

00:10:24.584 --> 00:10:27.144
Now tell me where Big Brother went!

00:10:28.424 --> 00:10:30.054
She's not lying to you.

00:10:30.054 --> 00:10:32.614
That really is him.

00:10:33.064 --> 00:10:37.464
Maika, it IS Big Brother Haruo!

00:10:57.084 --> 00:10:58.884
NO WAY!

00:10:58.884 --> 00:11:01.524
Big Sis!

00:11:01.524 --> 00:11:07.084
Hey, get a hold of yourself! Maika! Maika!

00:11:19.644 --> 00:11:23.734
SAKURAMORI ACADEMY
SWIMMING POOL

00:11:35.654 --> 00:11:38.064
Big Sis, are you okay now?

00:11:38.064 --> 00:11:40.224
I'm fine!

00:11:40.224 --> 00:11:42.754
I'm gonna get Big Brother back no matter what!

00:11:43.394 --> 00:11:47.404
Of course we will! I'd have a big problem
without Haruo anyway!

00:11:47.404 --> 00:11:50.104
But why him?

00:11:50.104 --> 00:11:54.064
We don't know why, but whatever it was,
it took his insides!

00:11:56.044 --> 00:11:58.144
I didn't feel any magical power.

00:11:58.144 --> 00:12:01.354
So I don't think it was the work of a witch.

00:12:01.354 --> 00:12:05.224
Good grief! What are YOU GUYS doing here?!

00:12:05.224 --> 00:12:07.284
YOU are the cause of this whole thing!

00:12:07.284 --> 00:12:11.024
My ultimate goal is to eliminate
an evil witch, remember?

00:12:11.564 --> 00:12:15.134
Anyway! We don't know what
our enemy is capable of,

00:12:15.134 --> 00:12:17.804
so we have to work together
to get through this, otherwise...

00:12:17.804 --> 00:12:22.104
I'm reluctant to team up with witches,
but this is all for him.

00:12:22.104 --> 00:12:23.864
I guess I have no choice.

00:12:26.444 --> 00:12:27.934
Um...

00:12:28.444 --> 00:12:31.374
The weirdoes got here before us AGAIN.

00:12:32.014 --> 00:12:34.554
Hey, you two! What do you think you're doing?

00:12:34.554 --> 00:12:35.314
Huh?

00:12:35.314 --> 00:12:37.254
What are you guys doing out here this late at night?

00:12:37.254 --> 00:12:42.454
Well, no matter how hard I try to hide it,
I guess the truth is always bound to be exposed.

00:12:42.754 --> 00:12:44.464
What the hell are you talking about?

00:12:44.464 --> 00:12:46.954
This pool is off limits to unauthorized students!

00:12:47.534 --> 00:12:52.964
But you know, Miss Yuri, power can
never suppress a man's curiosity!

00:12:53.304 --> 00:12:54.104
What?

00:12:54.104 --> 00:12:58.904
According to our investigation, some astral residue
has been detected in the pool water!

00:12:59.074 --> 00:13:00.404
There's no doubt about it!

00:13:00.404 --> 00:13:04.944
This disturbance was in fact caused
by an act of spirits!

00:13:04.944 --> 00:13:05.784
Oh, yes!

00:13:05.784 --> 00:13:11.424
