00:15:39.404 --> 00:15:41.304
Ghosts possess that much power?!

00:15:41.304 --> 00:15:43.904
At this rate, we won't even be able to get near her!

00:15:43.904 --> 00:15:45.874
That's not the ghost's power.

00:15:45.874 --> 00:15:47.304
That's Yoshikawa's power!

00:15:47.304 --> 00:15:49.044
What do you mean by that?

00:15:49.044 --> 00:15:50.274
Take a look at that!

00:15:50.644 --> 00:15:54.084
The ghost is making Yoshikawa's power her own!

00:15:54.084 --> 00:15:58.184
So Haruo does have hidden magical power!

00:15:58.184 --> 00:16:02.084
Not to mention she got so much power
from sucking out just a little bit!

00:16:02.754 --> 00:16:03.924
HEY!

00:16:03.924 --> 00:16:06.024
Why the hell did you decide
to possess Big Brother?!

00:16:06.024 --> 00:16:07.894
You give him back to me right now!

00:16:07.894 --> 00:16:08.164
You stupid ghost! Idiot ghost!

00:16:08.164 --> 00:16:12.864
Anytime he's involved, Maika
starts acting really dumb, you know.
You stupid ghost! Idiot ghost!

00:16:14.604 --> 00:16:16.874
It looks like we're on the same wavelength.

00:16:16.874 --> 00:16:20.064
It feels like there's this incredible amount
of power just overflowing!

00:16:23.444 --> 00:16:27.114
See? Now I can even touch things!

00:16:27.114 --> 00:16:30.244
Now I should be able to make
my dream come true!

00:16:31.384 --> 00:16:32.254
Dream?

00:16:32.454 --> 00:16:36.794
I used to stay in that hospital over there.

00:16:36.794 --> 00:16:41.784
I was born sickly, so I spent
most of my life in the hospital.

00:16:46.104 --> 00:16:51.504
The only thing I could enjoy was watching
the kids playing outside my window.

00:16:51.504 --> 00:16:55.504
I especially admired the girls in their
summer swimsuits.

00:16:56.614 --> 00:16:58.814
So I told myself, "Once I get better,

00:16:58.814 --> 00:17:04.774
I'm going to buy a cute swimsuit
and play outside just like them."

00:17:09.754 --> 00:17:11.924
Oh, you poor thing!

00:17:11.924 --> 00:17:15.064
It sounds kinda different from the
story Big Brother told us.

00:17:15.064 --> 00:17:17.634
That's usually how it goes with "scary stories."

00:17:17.634 --> 00:17:18.504
BUT!

00:17:18.504 --> 00:17:20.934
I'll be just fine with this body!

00:17:20.934 --> 00:17:23.674
Soon I'm gonna be able to wear
a swimsuit and go swimming!

00:17:23.674 --> 00:17:25.374
This is not good.

00:17:25.374 --> 00:17:28.444
The image of Haruo is getting lighter and lighter!

00:17:28.444 --> 00:17:32.814
If we don't cut the link fast,
she's gonna suck everything out of Haruo!

00:17:32.814 --> 00:17:34.514
Big Bro is going to disappear?!

00:17:34.514 --> 00:17:36.354
Oh, no! Without him, I'll have to live
the rest of my life cursed!

00:17:36.354 --> 00:17:39.084
Big Brother! Big Brother!
Oh, no! Without him, I'll have to live
the rest of my life cursed!

00:17:39.084 --> 00:17:41.494
If my senior disappears, this world will be
destroyed by evil witches!

00:17:41.494 --> 00:17:43.524
How could I let this happen to him?
If my senior disappears, this world will be
destroyed by evil witches!

00:17:43.524 --> 00:17:47.094
Anyway, we have to distract her
and look for a chance to strike!

00:17:47.094 --> 00:17:49.924
Now that it's come down to this,
I don't care how this is gonna look!

00:17:50.794 --> 00:17:52.234
Ayumi? What are you doing?

00:17:52.234 --> 00:17:54.804
Just take your clothes off!

00:17:54.804 --> 00:17:56.974
Wh-What do you think you're doing?!

00:17:56.974 --> 00:17:58.304
You demon!

00:17:58.304 --> 00:18:00.344
I'm not into that kind of stuff!

00:18:00.344 --> 00:18:03.004
Hey, why are you so fast when
it comes to stuff like that anyway?!

00:18:04.444 --> 00:18:06.644
Why the heck are we dressed like this?

00:18:07.214 --> 00:18:10.784
I'm sure she'll get distracted
if she sees cute swimsuits like these!

00:18:10.784 --> 00:18:13.954
And as soon as she lets her guard down,
we'll catch her with our magic!

00:18:13.954 --> 00:18:15.224
I see!

00:18:15.224 --> 00:18:18.164
You're pretty crafty, just like I thought...

00:18:18.164 --> 00:18:18.994
Shut up, you.

00:18:19.594 --> 00:18:21.034
Anyway, let's do this!

00:18:21.034 --> 00:18:21.994
Roger!

00:18:22.764 --> 00:18:26.134
Check out my cute swimsuit!

00:18:26.134 --> 00:18:29.464
See! Wouldn't you love to wear it?

00:18:34.174 --> 00:18:35.404
We did it!

00:18:39.484 --> 00:18:41.444
Take this!

00:18:49.954 --> 00:18:52.094
Let my big brother go!

00:18:52.094 --> 00:18:53.584
Why you!

00:18:59.134 --> 00:19:02.464
Think you can keep up with my speed?

00:19:07.074 --> 00:19:08.714
Damn it!

00:19:08.714 --> 00:19:12.614
Why? I thought it was a cute swimsuit!

00:19:12.614 --> 00:19:15.814
But it didn't quite suit my taste.

00:19:15.814 --> 00:19:18.054
You self-centered ghost!

00:19:18.054 --> 00:19:20.224
I can't believe YOU just called her that...

00:19:20.224 --> 00:19:25.124
Oh, no! He's disappearing!

00:19:25.124 --> 00:19:27.124
It's because you're not sexy enough!

00:19:27.124 --> 00:19:29.434
What?! First of all YOU'RE the one
who made this mess!

00:19:29.434 --> 00:19:31.734
It was that dumb Haruo's fault
for getting caught by her!

00:19:31.734 --> 00:19:35.174
Grrr! Don't you talk bad about my big brother,
you wicked witch!

00:19:35.174 --> 00:19:37.634
Her hairstyle...

00:19:37.944 --> 00:19:39.134
Is it possible that...

00:19:44.484 --> 00:19:45.604
That hurt!

00:19:46.084 --> 00:19:48.744
Guys, wear this swimsuit!

00:19:58.564 --> 00:20:00.654
This is one retro-looking swimsuit...

00:20:02.164 --> 00:20:04.494
Th-That swimsuit...

00:20:05.264 --> 00:20:07.394
That's the swimsuit!

00:20:08.634 --> 00:20:10.074
Now's our chance!

00:20:26.524 --> 00:20:27.314
Here!

00:20:27.524 --> 00:20:28.424
Get in there!

00:20:32.664 --> 00:20:34.364
I guess we made it in time!

00:20:34.364 --> 00:20:36.454
Looks like it worked, huh?

00:20:37.534 --> 00:20:40.264
But at any rate, why such a tasteless swimsuit?

00:20:40.264 --> 00:20:41.834
Her hairstyle...

00:20:41.834 --> 00:20:45.604
It looked like the one that the school forced
female students to wear about 20 years ago.

00:20:45.604 --> 00:20:45.744
Sakuramori Academy
23rd Yearbook
It looked like the one that the school forced
female students to wear about 20 years ago.

00:20:45.744 --> 00:20:50.044
Sakuramori Academy
23rd Yearbook
So I figured that the school-issued swimsuit from
around that time would be the one she would like...

00:20:50.444 --> 00:20:52.344
Good job, Fuyuno!

00:20:52.344 --> 00:20:53.514
You think so?

00:20:53.514 --> 00:20:56.814
Now we have to figure out what
we're going to do with her!

00:21:05.324 --> 00:21:08.334
Okay, I wanna see you finally learn
how to swim today!

00:21:08.334 --> 00:21:10.234
Yeah, I know...

00:21:10.364 --> 00:21:11.994
Big Brother!

00:21:12.404 --> 00:21:14.264
Over here!

00:21:14.574 --> 00:21:16.804
O-Okay...

00:21:20.404 --> 00:21:21.804
Huh?

00:21:22.444 --> 00:21:24.004
I... I can swim!

00:21:25.784 --> 00:21:28.014
I can swim now, Mamiya!

00:21:34.124 --> 00:21:37.184
It feels like I've become one with the water!

00:21:39.164 --> 00:21:41.534
I did it, Maika!

00:21:41.534 --> 00:21:43.864
NOOOOOO!

00:21:43.864 --> 00:21:46.304
Check out my stroke!

00:21:46.304 --> 00:21:48.434
Big Brother! Big Brother!

00:21:48.434 --> 00:21:50.874
Hey, wait a minute, Haruo!

00:21:50.874 --> 00:21:53.474
Tell me what you've done to Yoshikawa!

00:21:53.474 --> 00:21:55.814
This must be the work of that evil witch!

00:21:55.814 --> 00:21:57.174
It's not me!

00:21:57.174 --> 00:21:59.014
It must be an aftereffect of
having his insides sucked out!

00:21:59.084 --> 00:22:01.914
Good grief, they sure are noisy!

00:22:01.914 --> 00:22:05.284
